<title>USA: A.M. Castle to acquire tube company.</title>
<headline>A.M. Castle to acquire tube company.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKLIN PARK, Ill. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.M. Castle Co said Tuesday it has reached an agreement to acquire Keystone Tube Co, a specialty distributor of tubular products to the fluid power industry.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Chicago-based Keystone had about $45 million in sales in 1996, A.M Castle said.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to close in 45 days, the industrial materials company said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
